{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And you must also take my son's mandrakes.</b> In astonishment — to do even this, to take also my son's mandrakes! Its Targum: וּלְמֵיסַב." "<b>Therefore he shall lie with you tonight.</b> Mine was this night's lying, and I give it to you in exchange for your son's mandrakes. And because she treated the righteous one's bed with contempt, she was not privileged to be buried with him (Niddah 31)."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:01:13.611501913Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}